## Verdict

**U66 regresses nothing we measure.** qemu, the zig and wasm fixed points, every
zig, wasm and Rust arm on cobblestone, roc and safari, safari's whole app, the
sweep and the Roc ladder all hold every U64 pass. The Rust work it asked for:
four new refusals ported (check gate 1,512/0) and the list header cost.

